:markdown
  Hi there,

  I noticed you've not used your Nitrous.IO box *#{@box.name}* for more than 3 months. In an effort to keep things lean, we are starting to terminate inactive boxes.

  Your box *#{@box.name}* will be terminated after #{@days} days (**#{@termination_date}**). You can prevent this from happening by starting your box and logging into it.

  Otherwise, if you have no use for the box nor its contents, there's nothing that you need to do. Your box *#{@box.name}* will be terminated after 5 days and will no longer be accessible. Your used N2O will be refunded and you should [create a new Nitrous.IO box](https://www.nitrous.io/app#/boxes).

  If you have any questions or need any help at all, let us know at [support@nitrous.io](mailto:support@nitrous.io).

  Cheers,<br>
  The Nitrous.IO Team
